# (0.27) OTEST on the text shell (NODESK): the OPL2 call (user/otest.s). Its console must
# match tests/otest.txt (tests/otest-noopl.txt before REV $0C), its OPL2 writes (emu816
# --log-opl) tests/otest.err.
1500 {esc}
+1500 otest\n
# otest 7 (at about 3.4 s) shows the classic machine with a note on: F12 back to the shell
4400 {F12}
